<!-- wp:heading -->
<h2 class="wp-block-heading">Off-Page SEO: questions</h2>
<!-- /wp:heading --></div>
<!-- /wp:group -->

<!-- wp:group {"className":"sb-faq","layout":{"type":"constrained"}} -->
<div class="wp-block-group sb-faq"><!-- wp:details -->
<details class="wp-block-details"><summary>What is the difference between citations, profile links and guest posts?</summary><!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>Citations are business listings with your name, address and phone, mainly a local SEO trust signal. Profile links come from accounts on established platforms. Guest posts are articles on other websites with a contextual link to you. Our guide <a href="/citations-vs-profile-backlinks/">explains when each one helps</a>.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph --></details>
<!-- /wp:details -->

<!-- wp:details -->
<details class="wp-block-details"><summary>Are the links dofollow?</summary><!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>Some are and some are not. Each platform and publisher decides. A natural link profile contains both, so we never sell "dofollow only" packages.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph --></details>
<!-- /wp:details -->

<!-- wp:details -->
<details class="wp-block-details"><summary>What does DR mean?</summary><!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>Domain Rating is an Ahrefs score from 0 to 100 estimating a site's link strength. Your guest post is placed on a site at or above the DR tier you order, measured on the day of publishing.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph --></details>
<!-- /wp:details -->

<!-- wp:details -->
<details class="wp-block-details"><summary>Will this improve my rankings?</summary><!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>Links are one of many ranking factors, and results depend on your site, content and competition. We guarantee the deliverables, not rankings.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph --></details>
<!-- /wp:details -->

<!-- wp:details -->
<details class="wp-block-details"><summary>Is this safe? I have heard links can cause penalties.</summary><!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>Google penalises manipulative link schemes such as PBNs, automated spam and hidden paid links. We use real platforms and real publishers, and keep sponsored labels where publishers require them.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph --></details>
<!-- /wp:details -->

<!-- wp:details -->
<details class="wp-block-details"><summary>Can I choose the anchor text?</summary><!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>Yes. Add your preferences to the brief. We mix branded, natural and partial-match anchors to keep your profile natural.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph --></details>
<!-- /wp:details --></div>
<!-- /wp:group --></section>
